    "message": "Mark full-day generated Scenario runs as long simulations\n\nFour tests run a generated Scenario for a whole day and take 39 to 85\nseconds each when run alone, yet the quick lane ran them. Mark them\nlong_simulation so `-m \"not long_simulation\"` leaves them out, and\nwiden the marker's description to cover them. Adding only the marker\ndoes not move a legacy file, so the placement rule now says so.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
